#~ "text with a case-insensitive regex "
#~ "such as `cache prefix|task memory`, "
#~ "optionally restricted to selected keys. "
#~ "Search results are capped matching "
#~ "lines; segment keys are listed in "
#~ "the history index."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当早期细节被 compaction 淘汰后，按 seg.N 键取回已存储的<span "
#~ "class=\"marker\">压缩对话摘录</span>。也可以用不区分大小写的正则（如 `cache "
#~ "prefix|task memory`）搜索 segment "
#~ "的标题和正文，并可限定在选中的键内。搜索结果按匹配行数设上限；segment 键列在 history "
#~ "index 中。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Maintains the task's goal, plan, success"
#~ " check, and learned facts. It keeps"
#~ " long tasks organized but does not"
#~ " edit project files."
#~ msgstr "维护任务 goal、plan、成功检查和已知事实。它帮助组织长任务，但不会编辑项目文件。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Some providers can run tools <span "
