#~ "itself</span>, without minacode executing "
#~ "anything. Web search is the main "
#~ "one: the model searches, reads the "
#~ "results, and answers with sources, all"
#~ " before the response comes back. This"
#~ " is off by default and enabled "
#~ "per provider with [`builtin_tools`](configuration.md"
